Package: technitium-console
Version: 1.4.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: 9M2PJU <9m2pju@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/byGarcia/technitium-console
Description: Modern administration console for Technitium DNS Server
 Static web console served by Technitium DNS Server 15.5 or later.
 This package lays the files down in /usr/share/technitium-console;
 point the server at them with DNS_SERVER_WEB_SERVICE_WWW_FOLDER_PATH.
 The one-line installer remains the recommended path on a live server.
